ICHIRAKU RAMEN — SHINOBI PATRON NOTICE
Posted with permission of the Konoha vendor licensing office

To all registered shinobi of the Hidden Leaf:

Ichiraku Ramen is proud to serve the shinobi who protect our village. As a token of appreciation, active-duty shinobi presenting a valid registration are eligible for the following:

- Standard shinobi discount on all bowls (miso, shoyu, tonkotsu, and the daily special)
- Loyalty tally: every tenth bowl on the house
- Post-mission "welcome home" bowl at reduced price for teams returning from C-rank and above

Proprietor: Teuchi. Service: Ayame.
Note: the stand's record for bowls consumed in a single sitting is unofficially held by a certain orange-clad genin. Challengers welcome; the discount does not extend to eating contests.

Thank you for your service. — Teuchi, Ichiraku Ramen
